<script setup>import {exportData,importData} from '../composables/useLocal';const props=defineProps({settings:Object,voice:Object});async function load(e){try{await importData(e.target.files[0])}catch(err){alert(err.message)}}</script><template><section class="panel settings"><div class="eyebrow">Privacidad y preferencias</div><h1>Configuración local</h1><div class="settings-grid"><article class="glass"><h2>Variante objetivo</h2><label><input type="radio" value="us" v-model="settings.variant"> American English</label><label><input type="radio" value="gb" v-model="settings.variant"> British English</label><p>Las alternativas válidas siguen visibles; la ruta elegida mantiene consistencia.</p></article><article class="glass"><h2>Modo</h2><label><input type="checkbox" v-model="settings.practice"> Mostrar ayudas de práctica y transcripciones</label><label><input type="checkbox" v-model="settings.reducedMotion"> Reducir movimiento decorativo</label><label><input type="checkbox" v-model="settings.highContrast"> Contraste reforzado</label></article><article class="glass"><h2>Voz exacta</h2><select v-model="voice.voiceURI"><option value="">Automática</option><option v-for="v in voice.englishVoices" :value="v.voiceURI">{{v.name}} · {{v.lang}}</option></select><p>{{voice.englishVoices.length}} voces inglesas detectadas.</p></article><article class="glass"><h2>Respaldo</h2><button class="aero-button" @click="exportData">Exportar JSON</button><label class="aero-button file">Importar JSON<input hidden type="file" accept="application/json" @change="load"></label><p>Si borras los datos del navegador, se pierde el progreso salvo que tengas un respaldo.</p></article></div></section></template>
